{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24880","headline":"早春即事 · 杨衡","name":"早春即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"眼重朝眠足，头轻宿醉醒。\n阳光满前户，雪水半中庭。\n候变随天气，春生逐地形。\n北檐梅晚白，东岸柳先青。\n葱壠抽羊角，松巢堕鹤翎。\n老来诗更拙，吟罢少人听。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24880.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24880","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}